{%- comment -%}
  Outputs "true" when the visitor's country has free shipping, nothing otherwise.

  A country has free shipping when it has a free shipping label in the shop metafield
  custom.shipping_country_display (the same data that shows the free shipping line on the
  product page).

  Usage:
  {% capture free_shipping %}{% render 'country-free-shipping' %}{% endcapture %}
  {% if free_shipping contains 'true' %}...{% endif %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign display_config = shop.metafields.custom.shipping_country_display.value
  if display_config.countries[localization.country.iso_code].label != blank
    echo 'true'
  endif
-%}
